IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Grazie alla neve, {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
è diventata tutta luccicante.
Hai notato, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ah, starei qui ad ammirarla
tutto il giorno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Vienes de visita con este frío? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Deberías estar en una isla tropical
disfrutando del sol{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Aunque yo soy la menos indicada
para hablar, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡estoy acampando en
un iglú, ja, ja, ja!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bisher waren alle in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
ausgesprochen freundlich zu mir.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das versüßt mir den Urlaub!
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Allerdings ist es auch etwas kalt.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber was will man anderes
erwarten?

TRANSLATION:
Affedersin, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}ama sen {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'dan mısın?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Aa, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}güzel!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Kış boyunca burada kamp yapıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
